      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمَخَ</span></b> , (S, K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمَخَ بِأَنْفِهِ</span>, (L,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمَخَ</span></b> , (K,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمْخٌ</span>, (L,) <i>He exalted,</i> or <i>magnified, himself; was proud;</i> (S, L, K;) <i>behaved proudly,
